        "text": "The following elements, at a minimum, shall be included in the fire prevention plan: (i) A list of the major workplace fire hazards and their proper handling and storage procedures, potential ignition sources (such as welding, smoking and, others) and their control procedures, and the type of fire protection equipment or systems whi",
