        "text": "The employer shall control accumulations of flammable and combustible waste materials and residues so that they do not contribute to a fire emergency. The APPENDIX TO SUBPART E - MEANS OF EGRESS This appendix serves as a nonmandatory guideline to assist employers in complying with the appropriate requirements of subpart E.",
